WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.757 --> 00:00:20.039
royal palace stood in a grand cobblestone square in the exact center of the city, its graceful spires

2
00:00:20.159 --> 00:00:21.300
reaching toward the sky.

3
00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:24.121
Normally the square was very crowded.

4
00:00:24.841 --> 00:00:28.783
Today, though, only a few people scurried across it, looking this way and that.

5
00:00:29.503 --> 00:00:30.724
And none of them were Reds.

6
00:00:31.484 --> 00:00:33.845
Zann and his friends stopped at the edge of the square.

7
00:00:34.885 --> 00:00:38.127
Perda, Gliss, and Darb stared at the palace in awe.

8
00:00:38.827 --> 00:00:40.088
Zann wasn't surprised.

9
00:00:40.788 --> 00:00:43.609
There definitely wasn't anything like this in Swamp Bottom!

10
00:00:44.249 --> 00:00:45.770
Just then Darb gasped.

11
00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:47.731
"What?" Zann asked.

12
00:00:48.411 --> 00:00:50.652
"Trolls!" Darb whispered, pointing.

13
00:00:51.372 --> 00:00:54.674
Several of the ugly, hulking creatures were lumbering across the square!

14
00:00:55.694 --> 00:00:57.675
The kids all ducked behind some shrubs.

15
00:00:57.695 --> 00:00:59.175
"Now what?"

16
00:00:59.556 --> 00:01:00.176
Gliss asked.

17
00:01:00.832 --> 00:01:05.555
"We can't just walk up to the palace with those trolls there, even with our disguises.

18
00:01:06.295 --> 00:01:07.656
They might recognize us."

19
00:01:07.676 --> 00:01:10.697
"We need a plan," Perda said.

20
00:01:10.717 --> 00:01:13.679
"Yeah," Zann said slowly.

21
00:01:13.719 --> 00:01:15.860
"And I think I have an idea."

22
00:01:16.621 --> 00:01:17.901
"What?" Darb asked.

23
00:01:17.921 --> 00:01:24.125
"When I was a little kid, I met a Void named Gert who was an animal caretaker at

24
00:01:24.185 --> 00:01:25.165
my parents' lab.

25
00:01:25.886 --> 00:01:30.692
He told me once that there's a secret way to sneak in or out of the palace," Zann

26
00:01:30.712 --> 00:01:36.995
said. "It's an underground tunnel that goes all the way from the palace to a big public park.

27
00:01:37.815 --> 00:01:42.637
Gert said the tunnel was built during the Old Times, when dark magic was everywhere.

28
00:01:43.418 --> 00:01:48.100
The king and queen needed a way to escape in case an enemy struck them with a Dousing

29
00:01:48.160 --> 00:01:50.461
spell to keep them from using their magic."

30
00:01:50.481 --> 00:01:53.462
"Really?" Gliss sounded hopeful.

31
00:01:53.482 --> 00:01:56.343
"Do you know which park Gert was talking about?"

32
00:01:57.024 --> 00:01:57.704
Zann nodded.

33
00:01:58.136 --> 00:02:00.297
"I used to pass it on the way to a friend's house.

34
00:02:01.158 --> 00:02:02.799
We could be there in fifteen minutes."

35
00:02:03.599 --> 00:02:04.900
He led the way through the city.

36
00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:08.342
Like the palace square, all the streets were deserted.

37
00:02:08.362 --> 00:02:10.583
"Where is everyone?"

38
00:02:10.943 --> 00:02:11.504
Gliss asked.

39
00:02:11.524 --> 00:02:15.366
"They're probably hiding from those trolls," Perda said.

40
00:02:16.166 --> 00:02:17.287
Soon they reached the park.

41
00:02:17.987 --> 00:02:21.589
It was even bigger than Zann remembered, taking up four city blocks.

42
00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:25.131
Dozens of tall stone statues dotted the grounds.

43
00:02:25.151 --> 00:02:28.005
"Wow." Gliss glanced around.

44
00:02:28.025 --> 00:02:31.587
"How are we ever going to find a secret tunnel entrance here?"

45
00:02:31.607 --> 00:02:35.529
"Did Gert give you any hints about where to search, Zann?"

46
00:02:35.809 --> 00:02:36.390
Perda asked.

47
00:02:36.410 --> 00:02:39.371
"Not that I can remember," Zann said.

48
00:02:39.391 --> 00:02:42.433
"Let's just split up and start looking around."

49
00:02:43.173 --> 00:02:46.695
His friends wandered off and started peering under and around the statues.

50
00:02:47.476 --> 00:02:51.478
Zann kicked at the park's paving stones, testing to see if any seemed loose.

51
00:02:52.299 --> 00:02:57.769
Zing followed Zann around for a while, but then the dragon spotted a buzz worm and started playing

52
00:02:57.789 --> 00:02:58.009
with it.

53
00:02:58.749 --> 00:03:01.590
The worm buzzed angrily as Zing tossed it into the air.

54
00:03:01.610 --> 00:03:04.911
"Settle down," Zann told the dragon.

55
00:03:04.931 --> 00:03:06.831
"You could help us search, you know."

56
00:03:07.652 --> 00:03:12.813
Zing ignored him, batting the buzz worm under a huge statue of a warrior mounted on a dragon.

57
00:03:13.613 --> 00:03:14.414
Zann sighed.

58
00:03:14.714 --> 00:03:17.074
Normally he enjoyed watching Zing play.

59
00:03:17.774 --> 00:03:18.875
But today wasn't normal.

60
00:03:19.275 --> 00:03:20.055
Not even close.

61
00:03:20.075 --> 00:03:21.656
"See anything?"

62
00:03:21.996 --> 00:03:25.169
he called to his friends, who were still checking out the other statues.

63
00:03:25.989 --> 00:03:27.769
Perda had even climbed on top of one.

64
00:03:29.210 --> 00:03:32.110
"Nothing out of the ordinary that I can see," she said.

65
00:03:32.130 --> 00:03:37.792
"We've been searching for half an hour and we're no closer to finding the tunnel entrance," Gliss said.

66
00:03:37.812 --> 00:03:40.213
"Maybe we should go back to the palace.

67
00:03:40.633 --> 00:03:42.053
The trolls might have left by now."

68
00:03:42.753 --> 00:03:45.574
Just then Zing let out a squawk of surprise.

69
00:03:45.594 --> 00:03:47.915
"Quit fooling around, Zing!"

70
00:03:48.355 --> 00:03:48.955
Zann called.

71
00:03:49.935 --> 00:03:52.276
He bent down and peered under the dragon statue.

72
00:03:53.116 --> 00:03:55.698
"We don't have time for His voice trailed off.

73
00:03:55.718 --> 00:03:57.739
"Zing?" "What's wrong?"

74
00:03:58.020 --> 00:03:58.580
Darb asked.

75
00:03:59.340 --> 00:04:01.782
"He ran under this statue," Zann said.

76
00:04:01.802 --> 00:04:04.024
"But now I don't see him."

77
00:04:04.784 --> 00:04:09.888
Then he gasped as Zing's head suddenly popped out from the belly of the stone dragon!

78
00:04:10.888 --> 00:04:13.970
By now Gliss had come over to examine the statue too.

79
00:04:14.771 --> 00:04:16.912
She blinked in surprise when she saw Zing.

80
00:04:16.932 --> 00:04:21.636
"I just checked this one—there was no hole or anything, I swear!

81
00:04:22.512 --> 00:04:24.853
I even felt under it as far as I could reach!"

82
00:04:25.733 --> 00:04:29.134
Zann dropped to his hands and knees and crawled under the stone dragon.

83
00:04:29.154 --> 00:04:34.295
"The hole must be hidden with some kind of a Camouflaging spell," he said.

84
00:04:35.296 --> 00:04:36.576
Zing had disappeared again.

85
00:04:37.376 --> 00:04:41.157
Zann pressed his hands against the spot where he'd just seen his dragon.

86
00:04:41.897 --> 00:04:45.118
At first all he felt was smooth, solid stone.

87
00:04:45.838 --> 00:04:50.980
But when he pressed a little harder, the stone dissolved and his hand disappeared into nothingness!

88
00:04:51.976 --> 00:04:52.617
"This is it!"

89
00:04:52.977 --> 00:04:54.138
he called, amazed.

90
00:04:54.158 --> 00:04:56.000
"We found the secret tunnel!"

91
00:04:56.820 --> 00:04:59.543
He twisted and shoved himself through the invisible hole.

92
00:05:00.604 --> 00:05:04.587
Now that he was inside, he could see that the entire statue was hollow!

93
00:05:05.628 --> 00:05:10.853
Zann glanced toward the back end of the statue just in time to see a spurt of flame

94
00:05:10.953 --> 00:05:12.074
coming from that direction.

95
00:05:12.774 --> 00:05:17.298
He crawled toward the flame and saw a narrow tunnel angled steeply downward.

96
00:05:18.059 --> 00:05:22.663
It was pitch-black except for the glow thrown off by Zing's fiery breath.

97
00:05:23.424 --> 00:05:25.886
Darb and the girls had climbed into the statue too.

98
00:05:25.906 --> 00:05:28.588
"Wait up, Zing!"

99
00:05:28.828 --> 00:05:29.429
Darb called.

100
00:05:29.449 --> 00:05:31.270
"You'll have to be our light."

101
00:05:31.290 --> 00:05:34.013
"Let's stay close together, okay?"

102
00:05:34.413 --> 00:05:35.534
Gliss sounded scared.

103
00:05:35.554 --> 00:05:38.457
"I don't want to get lost down here in the dark."

104
00:05:39.237 --> 00:05:41.059
Zann inched his way down the tunnel.

105
00:05:41.079 --> 00:05:44.862
"Whoa!" he cried as he started sliding fast.

106
00:05:45.583 --> 00:05:46.804
It was steeper than he'd thought!

107
00:05:47.488 --> 00:05:51.269
He landed on Zing's tail, and the dragon let out an offended squawk.

108
00:05:51.289 --> 00:05:53.790
"Sorry," Zann said.

109
00:05:53.810 --> 00:05:55.710
"You should've moved out of the way."

110
00:05:56.531 --> 00:05:58.651
He scooted aside as the others slid down.

111
00:05:58.671 --> 00:06:00.972
"That was a long way down!"

112
00:06:01.352 --> 00:06:02.132
Perda exclaimed.

113
00:06:02.933 --> 00:06:05.193
"How will we get back up there without magic?"

114
00:06:05.213 --> 00:06:10.175
"If we make it to the palace, we won't have to worry about that," Zann pointed out.

115
00:06:10.195 --> 00:06:11.995
"Come on, let's go."
